WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.000
Forward heavy connects before Level 2.

2
00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:02.800
Juri activates Feng Shui Engine without the held release.

3
00:00:02.800 --> 00:00:03.800
Forward heavy connects again during FSE.

4
00:00:03.800 --> 00:00:04.800
OD Go Ohsatsu launches Ryu.

5
00:00:04.800 --> 00:00:05.400
Forward medium chains into crouching medium kick.

6
00:00:05.400 --> 00:00:05.850
Standing heavy kick chains into standing heavy punch.

7
00:00:05.850 --> 00:00:06.800
Go Ohsatsu continues the juggle with no Fuha stock shown.

8
00:00:06.800 --> 00:00:08.300
Heavy Tensenrin completes the FSE route.
